<title>NETHERLANDS: NBMAMSTELLAND DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>NBMAMSTELLAND DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch builder NBM-Amstelland said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 43 held.</p>
<p>In April, NBM announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.10 guilders. The payment could be taken up in cash or as an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>NBM Amstelland shares traded at 48.60 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday, down ten cents from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
